{
  "actual_model": null,
  "adapter_translations": [
    "Every workspace gets home/, artifacts/ and bin/ beside the frozen product files; installed/, home/, artifacts/ and bin/ are excluded from Git status through .git/info/exclude.",
    "Debugging and prose inputs are plain directories, so the runner commits them once with a fixed author and date. HEAD, index and the final diff then exist for every condition alike.",
    "Each payload is installed whole under installed/payload/. Mana entrypoints are relative to skills/, reference entrypoints to the repository root, so pstack/ group paths gain a pstack/ prefix.",
    "The reference arm installs the complete package in every group, so groups frozen against pstack/ alone also receive cursor-team-kit/skills/deslop/, which poteto-mode names before a commit.",
    "Evaluator tool doubles from the inputs go to bin/, first on PATH in every condition. A double exit 97 is a refused write or install measured by the group grader, never a harness stop."
  ],
